{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "1549eaeb-bdb1-46dc-8296-b69a6c07580b",
      "name": "Webhooks",
      "description": {
        "content": "Register HTTPS endpoints to receive signed notifications when a workflow reaches a terminal\nstate, instead of polling for status. You subscribe to one or more event types per webhook.\n\n| Event type | Fires when a workflow's status becomes |\n| --- | --- |\n| `WORKFLOW_COMPLETED` | `COMPLETE` |\n| `WORKFLOW_FAILED` | `FAILED` |\n\nAll management endpoints live under `/orgs/webhooks` and authenticate with a secret API key\n(passed as a bearer token) that has webhook access. Publishable keys cannot manage webhooks.\n\n**Integration checklist**\n\n- Receiver is a public HTTPS endpoint (no private IPs).\n- Save the `signing_secret` when you create the webhook — it is shown only once.\n- Verify `X-Halliday-Signature` against the raw body, accepting any of its comma-separated signatures.\n- Respond `2xx` quickly and do the real work afterward.\n- Skip deliveries whose `id` you have already handled.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "401490b8-3444-4505-83cd-1fbe78dbb073",
          "name": "Register a webhook",
          "request": {
            "name": "Register a webhook",
            "description": {
              "content": "Register an HTTPS endpoint to receive signed event notifications when a workflow reaches a\nterminal state. Halliday delivers each event as an HTTP `POST` to your registered `url`, so the\nendpoint must accept `POST` requests. On success the response includes a `signing_secret` that\nis **only ever returned on creation and rotation** — store it immediately, because it cannot be\nretrieved again from the list endpoint.\n\nAuthenticate with a secret API key that has webhook access. Publishable keys cannot manage webhooks.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "orgs",
                "webhooks"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"url\": \"<uri>\",\n  \"label\": \"<string>\",\n  \"event_types\": [\n    \"<string>\"\n  ],\n  \"auth_header\": {\n    \"name\": \"<string>\",\n    \"value\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"signing_secret\": \"<string>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [
